# Item 6 scaled-campaign ephemeral OS process state (meaningless once the session restarts)
item6_scale/pids/
# Per-iteration raw libFuzzer logs churn constantly while a campaign is running (one file
# every 60-300s) and add no information campaign_summary.log doesn't already capture (it
# records each iteration's tail). Keep campaign_summary.log + driver.out tracked; drop the
# per-iteration noise.
item6_scale/*/logs/iter_*.log

# Item 7 Fuzzware campaign: build outputs and the full AFL/Fuzzware project
# tree (queue/traces/mmio_states/config_snippets/per-session backups) are
# large, ephemeral working state with internal session/backup bookkeeping
# of its own (see FAILURE_TAXONOMY.md) and carry no information beyond what
# is already curated into item7_fuzzware/evidence/ and cited in RESULTS.md.
# Drop all generated campaign output; keep source/build-script/config and
# the curated evidence directory.
item7_fuzzware/*.elf
item7_fuzzware/*.bin
item7_fuzzware/*.o
item7_fuzzware/*.map
item7_fuzzware/config/*.bin
item7_fuzzware/config/run1/
item7_fuzzware/config/run1_old/
